미확인')}</span>)}</div></div>}<button className="button primary" disabled={!day||busy||loading||!!error||!transferFrom.trim()||!transferTo.trim()} onClick={()=>open('transfer',{...dayData,transportPlan:dayData.transportPlan||{from:transferFrom.trim(),to:transferTo.trim(),mode:'train',departureDate:day?.date,departureTime:'',departurePlace:'',arrivalPlace:'',bookingStatus:'unverified',connectionStatus:'unverified',bikeStatus:'unverified',reference:'',details:''}})}>{dayData.transportPlan?t('Edit saved transfer','저장된 이동 수정'):t('Save transfer details','이동 정보 저장')}</button></section></TabsContent>
 <TabsContent value="group"><div className="section-row"><div><p className="eyebrow">{t('RIDE TOGETHER','함께 달리는 여행')}</p><h2>{t('Riders & attendance','라이더 및 참석 여부')}</h2></div><button className="button primary" onClick={()=>open('rider')}><Plus size={16}/>{t('Add rider','라이더 추가')}</button></div><p className="muted">{t('Records are saved in this browser only. Check-ins and pickup notes are not sent to other riders. Export your itinerary to keep a backup.','기록은 이 브라우저에만 저장됩니다. 체크인과 픽업 메모는 다른 라이더에게 전송되지 않습니다. 일정을 내보내 백업하세요.')}</p>{!riders.length?<section className="panel empty"><Users size={40}/><h3>{t('Who’s coming along?','누구와 함께 가나요?')}</h3><p>{t('Add riders to track individual stamps and daily participation.','라이더를 등록하면 개인별 도장과 일별 참석 여부를 기록할 수 있습니다.')}</p><button className="button primary" onClick={()=>open('rider')}>{t('Add a rider','라이더 등록')}</button></section>:riders.map(r=><section className="panel" key={r.id}><div className="section-row"><h2><span className="avatar">{r.name.charAt(0)}</span>{r.name}</h2><button className="text-button" onClick={()=>{setRider(r.id);setTab('passport');}}>{t('View passport','인증수첩 보기')} <ArrowRight size={16}/></button></div><div className="attendance">{days.map(d=><label key={d.id}><Checkbox disabled={busy||loading||!!error} checked={!!records[`attendance:${r.id}:${d.id}`]?.yes} onCheckedChange={v=>save(`attendance:${r.id}:${d.id}`,{yes:!!v})}/><span>{d.date.slice(5)}<small>{ko?d.ko:d.title}</small></span></label>)}</div><div className="row wrap"><label className="check-label"><Checkbox disabled={busy||loading||!!error} checked={!!records[`attendance:${r.id}:${trip}:dinner`]?.yes} onCheckedChange={v=>save(`attendance:${r.id}:${trip}:dinner`,{yes:!!v})}/>{t('Attending final dinner','최종 만찬 참석')}</label><span className="muted small">{records[`checkin:${r.id}:${trip}`]?.status||t('No check-in yet','아직 체크인하지 않았습니다')}{records[`checkin:${r.id}:${trip}`]?.date&&' · '+new Date(records[`checkin:${r.id}:${trip}`].date).toLocaleString(ko?'ko-KR':'en-US',{timeZone:'Asia/Seoul'})}</span></div><div className="row wrap">{[['Starting','출발'],['At checkpoint','인증센터 도착'],['At hotel','숙소 도착'],['Pickup needed (local note)','픽업 필요 (기기 내 메모)']].map(([en,kr])=><button className="button outline" disabled={busy||loading||!!error} key={en} onClick={()=>save(`checkin:${r.id}:${trip}`,{status:t(en,kr),date:new Date().toISOString()})}>{t(en,kr)}</button>)}</div></section>)}</TabsContent>
 </Tabs><footer><span>KOREA RIDE <span className="muted">/</span> {t('All times Korea Standard Time','모든 시간은 한국 표준시')}</span><button className="text-button" onClick={refresh}><RefreshCw size={14}/>{loading?t('Loading…','불러오는 중…'):t('Refresh saved data','저장된 데이터 새로고침')}</button></footer></div></div>
